<title>FRANCE: Noumea airport airfreight throughput grows in July.</title>
<headline>Noumea airport airfreight throughput grows in July.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airfreight handled at Noumea/La Tontouta airport on the French Polynesian island of New Caledonia, totalled 397.4 tonnes last month a rise of 30.6 percent on July 1995.</p>
<p>Air Caledonie International generated 44 percent of air cargo throughput with Air France's share being 19.6 percent and independent French airline, Air Outre Mer, 14.1 percent.</p>
<p>Postal traffic handled at the airport totalled 75.7 tonnes a rise of 23.1 percent on July 1995. - Air Cargo Newsroom tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
